# Local lint target law (web/home):
# - dist/: the prestruct build artifact (gitignored like web/*/dist/). It is
#   swept for HTML truth by scripts/check-home.js (lint:home), not a JS lint
#   target — the emitted minified assets will always trip style rules.
# - node_modules/: dependency payloads (auto-ignored by eslint, stated here
#   for humans reading the tree).
dist/
node_modules/
#
# Wave 19.3: the lint gate is wired for real now. .eslintrc.json sits next
# to this file (app-local, so web/home self-lints without demanding the
# pod's config), linting js/mjs/jsx with JSX-aware unused-import rules
# (eslint-plugin-react). The stylistic law itself (no semicolons, single
# quotes, module style) stays owned by scripts/check-web-home-style.js on
# the pod side (lint:home) - this gate catches structural rot only.
